---
// Quiz figure for go-errors-defer-panic set 01: an error wrapped twice with %w, drawn as three linked values.
// It shows what each layer holds; it does not name the call that walks the chain.
// Inline SVG, site tokens only, no <marker>/<defs>/ids.
---
<div class="qfig-gq05ec">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 230" role="img" aria-label="An error value err pointing to an outer wrapper, which holds a middle wrapper, which holds the sentinel ErrNotFound.">
    <text x="0" y="20" class="qfig-gq05ec-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>One error, wrapped twice with %w</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Một lỗi, bọc hai lần bằng %w</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x="8" y="92" class="qfig-gq05ec-c">err</text>
    <line x1="40" x2="62" y1="88" y2="88" class="qfig-gq05ec-ln" />

    <rect x="64" y="52" width="140" height="76" rx="8" class="qfig-gq05ec-cell" />
    <text x="134" y="76" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq05ec-w">
      <tspan data-lang-en>outer wrapper</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>lớp bọc ngoài</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="134" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq05ec-m">"handle: ..."</text>
    <text x="134" y="116" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq05ec-m">wraps →</text>

    <line x1="204" x2="226" y1="90" y2="90" class="qfig-gq05ec-ln" />

    <rect x="228" y="52" width="140" height="76" rx="8" class="qfig-gq05ec-cell" />
    <text x="298" y="76" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq05ec-w">
      <tspan data-lang-en>middle wrapper</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>lớp bọc giữa</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="298" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq05ec-m">"load: ..."</text>
    <text x="298" y="116" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq05ec-m">wraps →</text>

    <line x1="368" x2="390" y1="90" y2="90" class="qfig-gq05ec-ln" />

    <rect x="392" y="52" width="168" height="76" rx="8" class="qfig-gq05ec-end" />
    <text x="476" y="76" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq05ec-w">
      <tspan data-lang-en>sentinel</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>sentinel</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="476" y="98" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq05ec-m">ErrNotFound</text>
    <text x="476" y="116" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq05ec-m">"not found"</text>

    <rect x="20" y="152" width="540" height="62" rx="8" class="qfig-gq05ec-card" />
    <text x="36" y="176" class="qfig-gq05ec-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Each wrapper keeps the error it wrapped inside it.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Mỗi lớp bọc giữ lỗi mà nó bọc ở bên trong.</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="36" y="200" class="qfig-gq05ec-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>The text of the outer wrapper is longer than "not found".</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thông báo của lớp bọc ngoài dài hơn "not found".</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-gq05ec { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-gq05ec svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-gq05ec text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-gq05ec .qfig-gq05ec-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq05ec .qfig-gq05ec-c { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq05ec .qfig-gq05ec-w { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq05ec .qfig-gq05ec-m { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-gq05ec .qfig-gq05ec-b { fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-gq05ec-cell { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qfig-gq05ec-end { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-3); stroke-width: 2; }
  .qfig-gq05ec-ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qfig-gq05ec-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
</style>
